    "description": {
      "value": "<div class=\"rd__b  rd__b--2\"><p><em>護甲（重甲），珍稀（需同調）</em><br />這套奇形怪狀的黑白色調護甲鑄成於 <strong>墮影冥界Shadowfell</strong> 之中，它充滿着那個可怕位面的幽影能量。<br />穿着這套護甲期間，你爲防止陷入或結束 <strong>恐慌Frightened</strong> 狀態所做的豁免具有優勢。<br />這套護甲具有3發充能。你可以消耗一發充能以用其施展法術<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack-zh-tw.new-icon.Item.6MYwBtZurc8Zw1ac]{安定心神 Calm Emotions}</em>（豁免DC15）。這套護甲在每日黎明時分恢復[[/r 1d3]]發已消耗的充能數。</p><p><span style=\"font-family:'Roboto Condensed', sans-serif\">該護甲由互相鎖接的金屬環編成。鍊甲還包括在甲冑下面穿戴的一層織物襯裏，用以阻止擦傷並減緩揮擊的衝擊。此護甲同時還附有護手。</span></p><p>This intricate grayscale armor was forged in the Shadowfell and is infused with that plane's gloom.</p><p>While you're wearing this armor, you have advantage on saving throws you make to avoid or end the frightened condition on yourself.</p><p>This armor has 3 charges. You can expend a charge to cast the @spell[Calm Emotions] spell (save DC <span class=\"rd__dc\">15</span>) from the armor. This armor regains [[/r 1d3]] expended charges daily at dawn.</p><p>Made of interlocking metal rings, chain mail includes a layer of quilted fabric worn underneath the mail to prevent chafing and to cushion the impact of blows. The suit includes gauntlets.</p></div>",
      "chat": ""
    },
